---
// src/pages/legal/shipping-returns.astro
import StorefrontLayout from '../../layouts/StorefrontLayout.astro';
---

<StorefrontLayout
  title="Shipping & Returns | DEYNOLD DANNY"
  description="Complimentary express delivery, white-glove packaging, and return policies."
>
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-white">
    <article class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-8 pb-24 text-neutral-800 font-light leading-relaxed">
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-8">
        <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-400 font-mono">
          <li>
            <a href="/" class="hover:text-black transition-colors">Home</a>
          </li>
          <li class="select-none">/</li>
          <li class="text-neutral-900 font-medium" aria-current="page">
            Shipping & Returns
          </li>
        </ol>
      </nav>

      <div class="mb-12 border-b border-neutral-100 pb-8">
        <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] font-mono text-neutral-400 block mb-2">
          Client Fulfillment
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-light tracking-tight text-neutral-900 font-serif">
          Delivery & Returns
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 font-mono mt-2">White-Glove Global Logistics</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-8 text-sm text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-base font-serif text-neutral-900 uppercase tracking-wide">1. Complimentary Express Delivery</h2>
          <p>
            We provide complimentary insured express shipping across India on all orders exceeding ₹10,000. Orders placed before 14:00 IST are dispatched the next business day. Deliveries typically arrive within 2–4 business days via DHL Express or Blue Dart Apex.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-base font-serif text-neutral-900 uppercase tracking-wide">2. Signature Presentation Box</h2>
          <p>
            Every order is encased in the signature DEYNOLD DANNY magnetic presentation box, wrapped in archival tissue paper, and accompanied by an archival hanger and breathable garment travel cover.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-base font-serif text-neutral-900 uppercase tracking-wide">3. 14-Day Complimentary Returns</h2>
          <p>
            Items may be returned within 14 days of delivery. Returned pieces must remain unworn, unaltered, with original security tags and garment bags intact. Bespoke customized and monogrammed creations are final-sale.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-base font-serif text-neutral-900 uppercase tracking-wide">4. Initiating a Return</h2>
          <p>
            To arrange a complimentary courier collection, please visit your Client Account dashboard or email <span class="font-mono text-neutral-900">returns@deynolddanny.com</span> quoting your order reference.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</StorefrontLayout>

